    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA splendidly located property close to the picturesque coastal village of Claddaghduff. \nSet on mature grounds, the house is also convenient to the equally picturesque Cleggan from which a daily ferry sails to the stunningly beautiful island of Inishbofin.\nAccommodation includes four bedrooms ,living room, dining room, kitchen, family bathroom and utility room. \nLarge corner windows in the living area allow lovely views towards Omey strand and the islands beyond. The adjacent garage is ideal for conversion with potential to further enhance the views towards Inishbofin and the open Atlantic.\nOmey Island is a popular destination along the Wild Atlantic Way and is easily accessible at low tide. There are numerous white sand beaches convenient to the property. \nTen kilometres away is the vibrant town of Clifden, renowned for it's many fine restaurants, bars and lively entertainment.\nThis is the perfect holiday location in an unspoilt and peaceful setting."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 33.80 x 1.83\nTiled floor.\n\nLiving Room - 5.30 x 3.70\nCorner windows to sea and island views\n\nDining Room - 3.80 x 2.86\nViews to sea and islands\n\nKitchen - 4.57 x 3.80\nTiled floor. Overlooking back garden.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.50 x 3.61\nBuilt in wardrobe.Overlooking front garden.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.00 x 2.65\nBuilt in wardrobe.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.06 x 2.84\nOverlooking back garden\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.61 x 3.06\nOverlooking front garden. Built in wardrobe\n\nBathroom - 2.80 x 1.90\nFully fitted and tiled\n\nUtility Room - 4.44 x 1.50\nDoor to rear garden\n\nGarage - 7.40 x 4.50\n\n\n"
      },
